{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/sizeThatFits(proposal:subviews:cache:)"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the size of the composite view, given a proposed size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the view’s subviews."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sizeThatFits"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"proposal"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI16ProposedViewSizeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ProposedViewSize"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subviews"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP8Subviewsa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Subviews"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"cache"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP5CacheQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Cache"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Size3DV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Size3D"}],"role":"symbol","title":"sizeThatFits(proposal:subviews:cache:)","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP12sizeThatFits8proposal8subviews5cache0A7Spatial6Size3DVAA16ProposedViewSizeV_AA0D8SubviewsV5CacheQzztF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","required":true},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sizeThatFits","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"proposal","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI16ProposedViewSizeV","text":"ProposedViewSize","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"subviews","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP8Subviewsa","text":"Subviews","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Subviews","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP5CacheQa","text":"Cache","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Cache","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Size3DV","text":"Size3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"proposal","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A size proposal for the container. The container’s parent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view that calls this method might call the method more than once","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with different proposals to learn more about the container’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flexibility before deciding which proposal to use for placement.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"subviews","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A collection of proxies that represent the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"views that the container arranges. You can use the proxies in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collection to get information about the subviews as you determine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"how much space the container needs to display them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"cache","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Optional storage for calculated data that you can share among","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the methods of your custom layout container. See","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"makeCache(subviews:)-23agy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for details.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A size that indicates how much space the container","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needs to arrange its subviews.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Implement this method to tell your custom layout container’s parent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view how much space the container needs for a set of subviews, given","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a size proposal. The parent might call this method more than once","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"during a layout pass with different proposed sizes to test the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flexibility of the container, using proposals like:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize\/zero","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" proposal; respond with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layout’s minimum size."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize\/infinity","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" proposal; respond with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layout’s maximum size."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize\/unspecified","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" proposal; respond with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layout’s ideal size."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The parent might also choose to test flexibility in one dimension at a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"time. For example, a horizontal stack might propose a fixed height and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an infinite width, and then the same height with a zero width.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example calculates the size for a basic vertical stack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that places views in a column, with no spacing between the views:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["private struct BasicVStack: Layout {","    func sizeThatFits(","        proposal: ProposedViewSize,","        subviews: Subviews,","        cache: inout ()","    ) -> CGSize {","        subviews.reduce(CGSize.zero) { result, subview in","            let size = subview.sizeThatFits(.unspecified)","            return CGSize(","                width: max(result.width, size.width),","                height: result.height + size.height)","        }","    }","","    \/\/ This layout also needs a placeSubviews() implementation.","}"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The implementation asks each subview for its ideal size by calling the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LayoutSubview\/sizeThatFits(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" method with an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize\/unspecified","type":"reference"},{"text":" proposed size.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It then reduces these values into a single size that represents","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the maximum subview width and the sum of subview heights.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because this example isn’t flexible, it ignores its size proposal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"input and always returns the same value for a given set of subviews.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OpenSwiftUI views choose their own size, so the layout engine always","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"uses a value that you return from this method as the actual size of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"composite view. That size factors into the construction of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"bounds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"input to the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/placeSubviews(in:proposal:subviews:cache:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/layout\/sizethatfits(proposal:subviews:cache:)"]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/LayoutSubview/sizeThatFits(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LayoutSubview\/sizeThatFits(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/layoutsubview\/sizethatfits(_:)","title":"sizeThatFits(_:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Asks the subview for its size."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sizeThatFits","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI16ProposedViewSizeV","text":"ProposedViewSize","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Size3DV","text":"Size3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Layout/Cache":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Cache"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Cache","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Cached values associated with the layout instance.","type":"text"}],"title":"Cache","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/layout\/cache","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","required":true},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ProposedViewSize":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProposedViewSize"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A proposal for the size of a view.","type":"text"}],"title":"ProposedViewSize","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/proposedviewsize","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProposedViewSize"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ProposedViewSize/unspecified":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/proposedviewsize\/unspecified","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize\/unspecified","title":"unspecified","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The proposed size with both dimensions left unspecified.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symb